From: xe3000-open-firmware <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] mediatek: gl-xe3000: add pcie_port_pm=off to kernel cmdline

Disable PCIe port power management for the XE3000 and X3000 boards so the
PCIe modem is not put into a link state it cannot leave. Applied to the
OpenWrt tree (not the kernel) by recipe/prepare.sh.

Signed-off-by: xe3000-open-firmware <noreply@example.invalid>
---
--- a/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7981a-glinet-gl-x3000-xe3000-common.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7981a-glinet-gl-x3000-xe3000-common.dtsi
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 
 / {
 	chosen {
-		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200n8 root=PARTLABEL=rootfs rootwait";
+		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200n8 root=PARTLABEL=rootfs rootwait pcie_port_pm=off";
 	};
 
 	aliases {
